<% content_for(:page_title) { "Developer Resources — Zambia National ETD Portal" } %>
<div class="netd-page netd-faq">
  <h1>Developer Resources</h1>
  <p>The portal's metadata can be reused through a JSON (REST) API and an OAI-PMH interface. The metadata comes from the
    participating institutional repositories; full texts stay in those repositories.</p>

  <h2>REST API (JSON)</h2>
  <p>Every search and record page is also available as JSON. No key is needed; please keep to a few requests per second.</p>
  <table class="netd-about netd-api">
    <tr><th>Search</th><td><code>GET https://netd.ac.zm/catalog.json?q=malaria</code></td></tr>
    <tr><th>Paging</th><td><code>&amp;page=2&amp;per_page=50</code> (up to 100 per page)</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Filter</th><td><code>&amp;f[institution_ssim][]=University+of+Zambia&amp;f[degree_level_ssim][]=Doctoral</code></td></tr>
    <tr><th>Sort</th><td><code>&amp;sort=latest</code> (also <code>relevance</code>, <code>earliest</code>, <code>title_az</code>, <code>title_za</code>)</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Search a field</th><td><code>&amp;search_field=title</code> (also <code>author</code>, <code>supervisor</code>, <code>subject</code>)</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Record</th><td><code>GET https://netd.ac.zm/catalog/unza-123456789-9150.json</code></td></tr>
    <tr><th>Facet values</th><td><code>GET https://netd.ac.zm/catalog/facet/institution_ssim.json</code></td></tr>
  </table>
  <p>Facet fields: <code>institution_ssim</code>, <code>full_text_ssim</code>, <code>degree_level_ssim</code>,
    <code>faculty_ssim</code>, <code>department_ssim</code>, <code>discipline_ssim</code>, <code>degree_ssim</code>,
    <code>supervisor_ssim</code>, <code>subject_ssim</code>, <code>year_ssim</code>.
    Search responses follow the JSON:API layout (<code>data</code>, <code>meta.pages</code>, <code>links</code>); each record's
    <code>attributes</code> include the title, authors, institution, year and links to the source record and full text.</p>
  <pre class="netd-code">curl -s "https://netd.ac.zm/catalog.json?q=malaria&amp;f[degree_level_ssim][]=Doctoral&amp;per_page=5"</pre>

  <h2>OAI-PMH</h2>
  <p class="netd-status">Status: in development. This interface is not yet available; the details below describe it as it is
    being built.</p>
  <table class="netd-about netd-api">
    <tr><th>Base URL</th><td><code>https://netd.ac.zm/oai</code></td></tr>
    <tr><th>Protocol</th><td>OAI-PMH 2.0; all six verbs (<code>Identify</code>, <code>ListMetadataFormats</code>, <code>ListSets</code>,
      <code>ListIdentifiers</code>, <code>ListRecords</code>, <code>GetRecord</code>)</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Metadata formats</th><td><code>oai_dc</code> (Dublin Core) and <code>etdms</code> (ETD-MS v1.1, for NDLTD)</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Sets</th><td>One per institution (for example <code>inst:unza</code>) and per degree level (<code>level:doctoral</code>, <code>level:masters</code>)</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Identifiers</th><td><code>oai:netd.ac.zm:&lt;record id&gt;</code>, e.g. <code>oai:netd.ac.zm:unza-123456789-9150</code></td></tr>
  </table>
  <pre class="netd-code">https://netd.ac.zm/oai?verb=ListRecords&amp;metadataPrefix=etdms&amp;set=inst:unza</pre>

  <h2>Source code and contact</h2>
  <p>The portal is open source:
    <%= link_to 'github.com/lightonphiri/code-datalab26-netd_aggregator', 'https://github.com/lightonphiri/code-datalab26-netd_aggregator', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' %>.
    Questions: <a href="mailto:datalab@unza.zm">datalab@unza.zm</a>.</p>
</div>
